    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist!</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882180/extras/11d6c5b7f60380368812b97cd5c02508.poster.avif?t=1664888822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882180/extras/11d6c5b7f60380368812b97cd5c02508.webm?t=1664888822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882180/extras/11d6c5b7f60380368812b97cd5c02508.mp4?t=1664888822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><br><h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882180/extras/0858c554c9a836606c8783b4ae62e681.avif?t=1664888822\" /></div><br>GACHI ADVENTURE: Billy's Legacy is a <i>truly</i> open-world role-playing game. You will find a variable plot with a unique atmosphere of Gachimuchi, a whole city available for free study and intense card battles. Find familiar characters, fight powerful opponents, write your own story in this wondrous and strange world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ent and history</h2>A long time ago, <strong>BILLY HERRINGTON</strong> founded the city of <strong>SHINNIPPORI</strong> to end chaos and anarchy forever. Despite all the difficulties, this place flourished. Unfortunately, good times don't last forever and one day Billy disappeared without a trace. The power in the city was divided among many factions, which was the beginning of a bloody civil war. <br><br>You are an ordinary <strong>BOY</strong> who came to <strong>SHINNIPPORI</strong> in search of a better life. What's wrong with <strong>BILLY</strong>? Who will become the new ruler of the city? How will this adventure change your hero and the world around him? The answers to these questions will be given by the plot of the game.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882180/extras/57c40b970a3d2b857a16850b879ce4b9.poster.avif?t=1664888822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882180/extras/57c40b970a3d2b857a16850b879ce4b9.webm?t=1664888822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882180/extras/57c40b970a3d2b857a16850b879ce4b9.mp4?t=1664888822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Variability and the open world</h2> During the passage, you will constantly have to make a choice that can change the direction of the story. Remember, your decisions have consequences for both your hero and other characters. The results of your actions will affect the state of the game world and the final ending.<br><br><strong>SHINNIPPORI</strong> is divided into 6 districts, each of which has its own unique style and narrative. All of them contain a lot of interesting characters, quests and points of interest. You will be able to thoroughly study each of them.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882180/extras/846e305726c20089da5dd050afcf08d9.poster.avif?t=1664888822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882180/extras/846e305726c20089da5dd050afcf08d9.webm?t=1664888822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882180/extras/846e305726c20089da5dd050afcf08d9.mp4?t=1664888822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Factions of the game</h2>Three main factions are fighting for power in the city. You can either help them settle permanently in <strong>SHINNIPPORI</strong>, or destroy them forever.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882180/extras/7fa0e28ff7c80bf31e364d307788d8cd.poster.avif?t=1664888822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882180/extras/7fa0e28ff7c80bf31e364d307788d8cd.webm?t=1664888822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882180/extras/7fa0e28ff7c80bf31e364d307788d8cd.mp4?t=1664888822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat system</h2>The combat system is a card-based battler inspired by Slay the spire. You have to collect your own unique deck of cards to test it in a tough battle. Test your tactical abilities <strong>for strength</strong>.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882180/extras/65c21c090a3e3b57f44e70be7033e7f7.poster.avif?t=1664888822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882180/extras/65c21c090a3e3b57f44e70be7033e7f7.webm?t=1664888822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882180/extras/65c21c090a3e3b57f44e70be7033e7f7.mp4?t=1664888822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You chose the right DOOR, BOY!</h2>Forward to an unforgettable adventure in GACHI ADVENTURE: Billy's Legacy<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882180/extras/925d1db162d59af27782174d192f3284.poster.avif?t=1664888822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882180/extras/925d1db162d59af27782174d192f3284.webm?t=1664888822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"